    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "Westerly winds are currently having a partial influence over Nepal.",
    "today_np": "देशभर आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy throughout the country. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशभर आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। गण्डकी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख केही स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy throughout the country. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Gandaki, Karnali and Sudurpashchim provinces. Fog/mist is likely at a few places in the Terai, valleys and river basins during the morning.",
